  "description": "Ma-Seong is a celebrity magician with a profound secret: he can actually move things with his mind! When he runs into a mysterious young woman with amnesia claiming to know him from a past life, Ma-Seong’s existence is upended. Cheon-Dong seems to attract attention wherever she goes, including that of Ma-Seong’s charismatic (but maybe evil) boss, Phillip, and Phillip’s lecherous half-brother, Pil-Yeong. Who is Cheon-Dong, why does she know so much about Ma-Seong, and will they be able to work through more than five centuries of baggage and just fall in love already? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
